        &lt;h2 class=&quot;text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-forest-900&quot;&gt;About FoodBridge&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;p class=&quot;text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700 leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
          FoodBridge is an Engineering &amp;amp; Technology Capstone (ETC) software project designed to solve local surplus food wastage with strict role-based portal separation (Donor, Admin, Receiver) and a 5-table relational database.
        &lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 pt-2&quot;&gt;
          &lt;div class=&quot;p-4 rounded-xl bg-cream-100 border border-[#E6E1D8]&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3 class=&quot;font-bold text-forest-800 text-sm mb-2&quot;&gt;Relational Database Schema (5 Tables)&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;ul class=&quot;text-xs text-gray-700 space-y-1.5&quot;&gt;
              &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Users:&lt;/strong&gt; Donor, Admin, and Receiver credentials &amp;amp; roles.&lt;/li&gt;
              &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Donations:&lt;/strong&gt; Food details, weight, prep time, storage, expiry &amp;amp; status.&lt;/li&gt;
              &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assignments:&lt;/strong&gt; Maps approved donations to verified NGO receivers.&lt;/li&gt;
              &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Status History:&lt;/strong&gt; Tracks every status change with actor &amp;amp; timestamp.&lt;/li&gt;
              &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Receipts / Collection:&lt;/strong&gt; Stores pickup confirmation &amp;amp; rescued weight.&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;div class=&quot;p-4 rounded-xl bg-cream-100 border border-[#E6E1D8]&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3 class=&quot;font-bold text-forest-800 text-sm mb-2&quot;&gt;Food Safety &amp;amp; Role Separation&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;p class=&quot;text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
              Donors cannot access Admin verification or Receiver collection pages. Admins review preparation time, storage temperature, and handling notes before publishing. FoodBridge supports responsible human review and does not claim automated safety guarantees.
            &lt;/p&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
