      &lt;div class=&quot;mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-[#E6E1D8]&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-gray-500 mb-2&quot;&gt;Demo Account Autofill (For Examiner Testing)&lt;/div&gt;
